{"id":"caa9b22df1480436","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-poset-galois-connection.md","title":"ZFC Poset Galois Connection","display":"df-zfc-poset-galois-connection — ZFC Poset Galois Connection","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-poset-galois-connection","aliases":["58-df-zfc-poset-galois-connection","58-df-zfc-poset-adjoint-pair"],"display":"df-zfc-poset-galois-connection — ZFC Poset Galois Connection","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-poset-galois-connection"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-poset-galois-connection</span><span>58-df-zfc-poset-adjoint-pair</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-poset-galois-connection — ZFC Poset Galois Connection"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g,P,Q,\\leq_P,\\leq_Q\\in V\">\\(f,g,P,Q,\\leq_P,\\leq_Q\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S,\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S,\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (predicates from dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetGaloisConnection}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcPosetAdjointPair}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPosetGaloisConnection}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcPosetAdjointPair}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}galois\\text{-}connection}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetGaloisConnection}_S(f,g,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S(Q,\\leq_Q)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,P,Q)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,Q,P)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall p\\in P\\;\\forall q\\in Q\\;\n\\left(f(p)\\leq_Q q\\leftrightarrow p\\leq_P g(q)\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}galois\\text{-}connection}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetGaloisConnection}_S(f,g,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S(Q,\\leq_Q)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,P,Q)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,Q,P)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall p\\in P\\;\\forall q\\in Q\\;\n\\left(f(p)\\leq_Q q\\leftrightarrow p\\leq_P g(q)\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}adjoint\\text{-}pair}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetAdjointPair}_S(f,g,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetGaloisConnection}_S(f,g,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}adjoint\\text{-}pair}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetAdjointPair}_S(f,g,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetGaloisConnection}_S(f,g,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The carrier sets and both order relations are explicit, and the merged\nadjoint-pair name delegates to a single defining predicate.</li>\n<li>Merges the adjoint-pair variant, which is the same poset Galois connection condition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"9ee45afab4c00dd5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f,g,P,Q,\\leq_P,\\leq_Q\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S,\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetGaloisConnection}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcPosetAdjointPair}_S\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}galois\\text{-}connection}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetGaloisConnection}_S(f,g,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S(Q,\\leq_Q)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,P,Q)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,Q,P)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\n\\forall p\\in P\\;\\forall q\\in Q\\;\n\\left(f(p)\\leq_Q q\\leftrightarrow p\\leq_P g(q)\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}adjoint\\text{-}pair}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetAdjointPair}_S(f,g,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetGaloisConnection}_S(f,g,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q).","display":true}],"bytes":1586,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3116","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-poset-galois-connection.md|58-df-zfc-poset-galois-connection]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","9ee45afab4c00dd5","36d7463d215be751"]}